    "intent": "Task 121 Phase 3 scan-efficiency A/B for the Phase 2 finalist family.",
    "scope": "Local PG18 RaBitQ b4/tr50/f8 at 10k, 50k, and 100k with leaf block summaries enabled; compare pruning off against sampled global block pruning.",
    "basis": "Packet 018 kept b4/tr50 as the practical Phase 3 candidate; Task 120 showed hard per-leaf block caps are not recall-safe, so this tests the softer sampled global recovery path.",
